    <bpmn:process id="W_W634" name="W634. Revenue Assurance &amp; POS Revenue Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily (automated); weekly comprehensive review
Frequency: Daily automated checks; weekly manual review; monthly comprehensive reconciliation
Volume: ~2.8M POS transactions/month across 200 stores; ~93,000 daily
Owner: Revenue Assurance Analyst
Participants: Store Manager (per store), LP Analyst, Finance Supervisor
Source: workflow W634 — Revenue Assurance &amp; POS Revenue Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W634_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W634_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W634_Lane2" name="Revenue Assurance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W634_Lane3" name="LP Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W634_Lane4" name="Finance Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W634_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W634_Start6" name="Daily (automated); weekly comprehensive review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W634_Task7" name="System auto-generates daily revenue reconciliation: POS gross revenue (from POS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-generates daily revenue reconciliation: POS gross revenue (from POS system) vs. ERP posted revenue (from GL) vs. bank-settled revenue (from card/e-wallet settlement files + cash deposit confirmations)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task8" name="Revenue Assurance Analyst reviews daily exceptions: POS-to-GL variances &gt; PHP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Analyst reviews daily exceptions: POS-to-GL variances &gt; PHP 1,000 per store, unbanked revenue (cash deposit shortfall vs. POS cash tender), settlement shortfalls from card/e-wallet processors
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Supervisor
Duration: 2 hours/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task9" name="For POS-to-GL variances: analyst investigates posting errors, duplicate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For POS-to-GL variances: analyst investigates posting errors, duplicate entries, missing transactions from offline POS recovery (W5G), or system interface failures
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task10" name="For pricing compliance: system flags transactions where applied price deviates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For pricing compliance: system flags transactions where applied price deviates &gt; 5% from system SRP or promotional price; Revenue Assurance Analyst investigates unauthorized overrides, sweethearting, or pricing master errors
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Accountable (A): LP Analyst
Duration: 1 hour/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task11" name="LP Analyst cross-references revenue anomalies with LP exception alerts (W538)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: LP Analyst cross-references revenue anomalies with LP exception alerts (W538) for fraud indicators: high void rates, excessive overrides, unusual discount patterns
Responsible (R): LP Analyst
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Duration: 1 hour/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task12" name="Weekly comprehensive review: Revenue Assurance Analyst produces store-level…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Weekly comprehensive review: Revenue Assurance Analyst produces store-level revenue assurance scorecard with variance trends, exception aging, and confirmed loss by category
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Supervisor
Duration: 4 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W634_Task13" name="Finance Supervisor escalates material issues (&gt; PHP 10,000 recurring variance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Finance Supervisor escalates material issues (&gt; PHP 10,000 recurring variance or confirmed fraud) to LP investigation (W248) and Store Manager accountability review
Responsible (R): Finance Supervisor
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: As needed</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W634_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W634_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W634_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W634_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: automated variance detection and threshold-based filtering; operational: offline recovery workflow and time-bound reconciliation windows; operational: LP Analyst cross-reference in Step 5
Owner: Revenue Assurance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
