        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: standardized lease abstraction template and lease accounting module; operational: automated IC elimination in consolidation module; operational: standard modification workflow and system-driven remeasurement
Owner: Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
