    <bpmn:process id="W_W714" name="W714. Store-Level Daily Financial Summary Reporting &amp; Flash P&amp;L" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: End of each store operating day
Frequency: Daily (all 200 stores)
Volume: 200 daily flash P&amp;L reports; consolidated into regional and national summary
Owner: Store Manager
Participants: Cashier (data input), Store Manager (review), Regional Manager (consolidation), FP&amp;A Analyst
Source: workflow W714 — Store-Level Daily Financial Summary Reporting &amp; Flash P&amp;L</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W714_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W714_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W714_Lane2" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W714_Lane3" name="Regional Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W714_Lane4" name="FP&amp;A Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W714_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W714_Start6" name="End of each store operating day">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W714_Task7" name="Automated data extraction (post store close)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Automated data extraction (post store close): after store close per W574, system automatically extracts: (a) gross revenue by department (Lumber, Plumbing, Electrical, Tiles, Tools, Hardware, Paint, Appliances, Garden, Services); (b) transaction count and average transaction value (ATV); (c) returns and voids count and value; (d) payment method mix (cash, card, e-wallet, trade account); (e) loyalty points earned and redeemed; (f) labor hours worked and overtime; (g) discount and promotion impact (markdown, employee discount, senior/PWD); (h) key service revenue (installation, cutting, rental)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W714_Task8" name="Flash P&amp;L generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Flash P&amp;L generation: system generates daily store flash P&amp;L: (a) Revenue: gross sales − returns − discounts = net revenue; (b) Estimated COGS: using category-level average margin from W85; (c) Estimated gross profit and margin %; (d) Estimated labor cost: hours worked × blended hourly rate from W613; (e) Other estimated variable costs: utilities allocation, supplies; (f) Estimated store contribution margin; (g) comparison vs. same day last year, vs. budget per W489, vs. last 4-week average; (h) variance flags: revenue ±10% vs. budget, margin ±2% vs. target, ATV ±15% vs. average
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W714_Task9" name="Store Manager review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store Manager review: Store Manager reviews daily flash by 09:00 next morning: (a) verify revenue total matches Z-report per W5F; (b) investigate significant variances: revenue drop (stockout? weather? competitor promo?); margin decline (excessive discounting? low-margin product mix shift?); (c) annotate variances with explanations in system; (d) flag items requiring Regional Manager attention
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 15-20 min/store/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W714_Task10" name="Regional consolidation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Regional consolidation: Regional Manager reviews daily flash for all stores in region (~30–40 stores): (a) system consolidates regional P&amp;L summary; (b) identify bottom 5 and top 5 stores by revenue and margin performance; (c) follow up on Store Manager variance annotations; (d) escalate systemic issues (e.g., regional weather event, supply disruption) to VP Store Operations
Responsible (R): Regional Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 30-45 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W714_Task11" name="National summary generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: National summary generation: FP&amp;A generates national daily financial summary by 10:00: (a) consolidated flash P&amp;L for all 200 stores; (b) revenue vs. budget tracking (MTD and YTD); (c) regional performance heat map; (d) top 10 positive and negative store variance narratives; (e) trend alerts: stores declining 3+ consecutive days; (f) summary distributed to C-suite via executive dashboard per RPT-001
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 30-60 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W714_Task12" name="Weekly trend analysis">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Weekly trend analysis: FP&amp;A compiles 7-day rolling analysis: (a) week-over-week trend by region and store cluster; (b) category-level revenue trend (which departments are driving/declining); (c) labor cost efficiency: revenue per labor hour; (d) promotion effectiveness: promotional vs. non-promotional revenue days; (e) weekly flash report submitted to CFO and VP Store Operations for W575 review
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2-3 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W714_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W714_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W714_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W714_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: Store Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
