    <bpmn:process id="W_W750" name="W750. Credit Card Installment Sales Reconciliation &amp; Bank Settlement Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily bank settlement file receipt; monthly bank statement arrival
Frequency: Daily reconciliation; monthly bank statement reconciliation
Volume: ~4,000 installment transactions/day chain-wide across the 4 acquiring banks (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Chinabank — the canon set)
Owner: Finance Analyst (Card Settlements)
Participants: Finance Analyst, Finance Manager, Bank Acquiring Operations
Source: workflow W750 — Credit Card Installment Sales Reconciliation &amp; Bank Settlement Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W750_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W750_Lane1" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W750_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W750_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W750_Start4" name="Daily bank settlement file receipt; monthly bank statement arrival">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W750_Task5" name="Daily settlement file download">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Daily settlement file download: Finance Analyst downloads daily settlement files from each acquiring bank (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Chinabank — the canon four-bank set); files contain transaction-level detail: card number (masked), transaction amount, installment term, MDR, and net settlement amount
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W750_Task6" name="Automated matching">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Automated matching: System auto-matches bank settlement transactions to POS installment transaction records (W747) by transaction reference, amount, and date; flags unmatched items for manual review
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Analyst
Duration: Automated + 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W750_Task7" name="MDR verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: MDR verification: System verifies MDR per bank per transaction against contracted rates in W309 bank master; flags any MDR discrepancies (&gt; 0.1% variance)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W750_Task8" name="Interest subsidy reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Interest subsidy reconciliation: For 0% promo transactions: system calculates expected interest subsidy deduction and reconciles against actual bank deduction; flags variances
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Analyst
Duration: Automated + 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W750_Task9" name="GL posting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: GL posting: System posts daily settlement: DR Bank (net amount), DR Interest Subsidy Expense (0% promo cost), DR MDR Expense, CR Installment Sales Receivable
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W750_Task10" name="Unmatched item resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Unmatched item resolution: Finance Analyst investigates unmatched items: (a) timing differences (post to next day), (b) bank errors (initiate dispute), (c) POS errors (coordinate with store)
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W750_Task11" name="Monthly bank statement reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly bank statement reconciliation: Monthly: Finance Analyst reconciles accumulated daily settlements against bank statement; investigates and resolves any remaining discrepancies per W89 bank reconciliation
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W750_Task12" name="Bank performance reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Bank performance reporting: Quarterly: Finance reports MDR trends, interest subsidy costs, settlement timeliness, and chargeback rates per bank; feeds to W149 bank partnership review
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W750_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W750_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W750_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W750_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: Finance Analyst (Card Settlements) review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Finance Analyst (Card Settlements)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W750_Assoc15" sourceRef="W750_Annotation14" targetRef="W750_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W750_Flow16" sourceRef="W750_Start4" targetRef="W750_Task5" />
