    <bpmn:process id="W_W751" name="W751. Store-Level Emergency Cash Float Request &amp; Expedited Replenishment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store cash position falls below minimum operational threshold; unexpected high-volume cash transaction day; till shortage requiring emergency replenishment
Frequency: 2–3 times per store per month (ad-hoc)
Volume: 200 stores × ~2.5 emergency requests/month = ~500 emergency requests/month chain-wide
Owner: Store Manager
Participants: Store Manager, Finance (Treasury), CIT Service (W174), Bank
Source: workflow W751 — Store-Level Emergency Cash Float Request &amp; Expedited Replenishment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W751_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W751_Lane1" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W751_Lane2" name="Treasury Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W751_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W751_Lane4" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W751_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W751_Start6" name="Store cash position falls below minimum operational threshold; unexpected high-volume…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task7" name="Emergency trigger">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Emergency trigger: Store Manager identifies cash shortage: (a) till float below PHP 20,000 per terminal (per W764), (b) no change available for high-denomination bills, (c) anticipated high-cash-volume day (payday, promotion)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task8" name="Emergency request submission">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Emergency request submission: Store Manager submits emergency cash request in system: amount needed, reason, urgency level (Standard: next-day, Urgent: same-day, Critical: within 4 hours); system validates against store cash budget (W489)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Finance
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task9" name="Finance approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance approval: Treasury Analyst reviews request: (a) validates against store cash budget, (b) checks if standard CIT schedule can accommodate, (c) approves/rejects with documentation
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task10" name="Cash sourcing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Cash sourcing: Finance determines fulfillment method: (a) expedited CIT delivery (W174) for urgent/critical, (b) bank branch emergency withdrawal by authorized store personnel, (c) inter-store cash transfer from nearby store
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task11" name="Cash receipt at store">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cash receipt at store: Store Manager or designated cash handler receives emergency cash; counts and verifies amount against request; signs receipt; system records emergency float addition
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W751_Task12" name="Reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Reconciliation: Emergency float tracked separately in system; reconciled in next EOD procedure (W541) and next bank reconciliation (W89)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task13" name="Root cause documentation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Root cause documentation: For recurring emergency requests (&gt; 3 per month for same store), Finance requires root cause documentation: (a) inadequate standard float allocation, (b) poor cash management practices, (c) seasonal volume shift
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W751_Task14" name="Float adjustment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Float adjustment: Based on root cause analysis, Finance adjusts store&#x27;s standard daily float allocation in W489 store-level budget to prevent recurrence
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W751_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W751_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W751_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W751_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: Finance Manager approval for urgent requests; operational: seasonal float auto-adjustment for Ber months and payday weekends
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W751_Assoc17" sourceRef="W751_Annotation16" targetRef="W751_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow18" sourceRef="W751_Start6" targetRef="W751_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow19" sourceRef="W751_Task7" targetRef="W751_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow20" sourceRef="W751_Task8" targetRef="W751_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow21" sourceRef="W751_Task9" targetRef="W751_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow22" sourceRef="W751_Task10" targetRef="W751_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow23" sourceRef="W751_Task11" targetRef="W751_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow24" sourceRef="W751_Task12" targetRef="W751_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow25" sourceRef="W751_Task13" targetRef="W751_Task14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W751_Flow26" sourceRef="W751_Task14" targetRef="W751_End15" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W751_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W751_plane" bpmnElement="W_W751">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W751_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W751_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="2000" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W751_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W751_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="2000" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W751_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W751_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="2000" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W751_Lane4_di" bpmnElement="W751_Lane4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="590" width="2000" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W751_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W751_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
