    <bpmn:process id="W_W764" name="W764. Store-Level Daily Opening Safe Count &amp; Cash Float Preparation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Start of each store business day
Frequency: Daily; 200 stores
Volume: 200 stores × 1 opening safe count + float preparation per day
Owner: Assistant Store Manager
Participants: Assistant Store Manager, Cashier (opening shift)
Source: workflow W764 — Store-Level Daily Opening Safe Count &amp; Cash Float Preparation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W764_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W764_Lane1" name="ASM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W764_Lane2" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W764_Lane3" name="ASM + Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W764_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W764_Start5" name="Start of each store business day">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task6" name="Safe access and dual-control open">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Safe access and dual-control open: Assistant Store Manager and opening Cashier open safe together per dual-control policy; both present during entire count
Responsible (R): ASM
Accountable (A): ASM
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task7" name="Overnight safe count verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Overnight safe count verification: Count all denominations in safe; compare to previous night&#x27;s closing safe count from W541; document variance; any variance &gt; PHP 50 triggers immediate investigation per W272
Responsible (R): ASM
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task8" name="POS terminal float preparation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: POS terminal float preparation: Prepare 3 cash floats per standard denomination mix: (a) PHP 20,000 per terminal (120 × PHP 100, 60 × PHP 50, 150 × PHP 20, 200 × PHP 10, 200 × PHP 5); total float: PHP 60,000 per store
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): ASM
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task9" name="Petty cash fund verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Petty cash fund verification: Verify petty cash float of PHP 20,000 per W25; count and record; reconcile against petty cash register
Responsible (R): ASM
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task10" name="System opening entry">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System opening entry: ASM records safe count and float disbursement in ERP cash management module; system logs opening balance per terminal; system links to W541 cash office close for overnight reconciliation
Responsible (R): ASM
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task11" name="Float disbursement to cashiers">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Float disbursement to cashiers: Each cashier signs for terminal float at shift start per W517; tamper-evident bag opened in cashier&#x27;s presence; both ASM and Cashier verify count
Responsible (R): ASM + Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min/terminal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W764_Task12" name="Exception handling">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Exception handling: If safe count variance detected: (a) document variance, (b) review CCTV footage from overnight per W71, (c) escalate to Store Manager, (d) if variance &gt; PHP 500, escalate to Regional LP per W248
Responsible (R): ASM
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15-30 min if exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W764_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W764_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W764_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W764_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: Assistant Store Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Assistant Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W764_Assoc15" sourceRef="W764_Annotation14" targetRef="W764_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow16" sourceRef="W764_Start5" targetRef="W764_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow17" sourceRef="W764_Task6" targetRef="W764_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow18" sourceRef="W764_Task7" targetRef="W764_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow19" sourceRef="W764_Task8" targetRef="W764_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow20" sourceRef="W764_Task9" targetRef="W764_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow21" sourceRef="W764_Task10" targetRef="W764_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow22" sourceRef="W764_Task11" targetRef="W764_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W764_Flow23" sourceRef="W764_Task12" targetRef="W764_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W764_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W764_plane" bpmnElement="W_W764">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W764_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W764_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
