    <bpmn:process id="W_W765" name="W765. Multi-Entity Consolidation Monthly Execution &amp; Elimination Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close cycle (W9A); after all entities complete individual month-end close
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 1 consolidated close per month covering 5 legal entities
Owner: Finance Manager (Consolidation)
Participants: Entity Controllers (5), FP&amp;A Analyst, Finance Manager, CFO
Source: workflow W765 — Multi-Entity Consolidation Monthly Execution &amp; Elimination Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W765_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W765_Lane1" name="Finance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W765_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W765_Lane3" name="Entity Controllers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W765_Lane4" name="System + Finance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W765_Lane5" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W765_End18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W765_Start7" name="Month-end close cycle (W9A); after all entities complete individual month-end close">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W765_Task8" name="Entity close completion verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Entity close completion verification: Finance Manager verifies all 5 entities have completed month-end close per W9A: all subledgers posted, all JEs approved per W638, bank reconciliations completed per W89, intercompany balances matched per IC-005
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W765_Task9" name="Intercompany balance reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Intercompany balance reconciliation: System performs automated IC balance matching across all entity pairs: (a) Depot Inc. ↔ Logistics Inc. (warehousing fees, IC inventory), (b) Depot Inc. ↔ Digital Commerce Inc. (ecommerce fees, payment remittance), (c) Depot Inc. ↔ Property Management Inc. (lease payments per W275), (d) Holdings ↔ all operating entities (management fees per W752); flag unmatched IC entries
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Entity Controllers
Duration: 30 min automated + 2 hours review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W765_Task10" name="IC discrepancy resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IC discrepancy resolution: For any unmatched IC balances: Entity Controllers investigate and resolve; common causes: timing differences (goods in transit), FX rounding, posting errors; corrections posted per W638 approval matrix
Responsible (R): Entity Controllers
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 1-4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W765_Task11" name="Consolidation elimination entries">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Consolidation elimination entries: System auto-generates elimination JEs: (a) IC AP/AR elimination, (b) IC revenue/expense elimination, (c) IC profit in inventory elimination per W234, (d) IC dividend elimination per W137, (e) IC management fee elimination per W752, (f) lease elimination (Depot Inc. ↔ Property Management Inc. per W635 PFRS 16)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Automated + 1 hour review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W765_Task12" name="Minority interest calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Minority interest calculation: If any entity has non-controlling interest (applicable if external shareholders exist per W327): system calculates NCI share of profit and equity
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W765_Task13" name="Consolidated trial balance generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Consolidated trial balance generation: System generates consolidated trial balance with eliminations; Finance Manager reviews for unusual balances, orphan eliminations, or missing entries
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W765_Task14" name="Consolidated financial statements">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Consolidated financial statements: System generates consolidated BS, IS, CF, and Equity Changes per PFRS 1; Finance Manager reviews presentation, disclosures, and classification
Responsible (R): System + Finance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W765_Task15" name="Intercompany profit in inventory">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Intercompany profit in inventory: System calculates unrealized IC profit in inventory remaining at month-end: (a) Logistics Inc. markup on goods held in Depot Inc. stores, (b) Digital Commerce Inc. markup on ecommerce inventory; elimination JE generated
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Automated + 30 min review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W765_Task16" name="Consolidation workpaper documentation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Consolidation workpaper documentation: Finance Manager prepares consolidation workpaper documenting: all elimination entries, IC reconciliation, non-controlling interest calculation, and consolidation adjustments; filed for external audit per W351
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W765_Task17" name="CFO review and sign-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: CFO review and sign-off: CFO reviews consolidated financial statements and workpaper; approves for management reporting per W35 and external filing per W481
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W765_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W765_End18" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W765_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W765_Annotation19">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: configuration
Owner: Finance Manager (Consolidation)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W765_Assoc20" sourceRef="W765_Annotation19" targetRef="W765_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
