    <bpmn:process id="W_W766" name="W766. Customer Credit Note Aging Management &amp; Unredeemed Credit Write-Off" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly credit note aging review cycle
Frequency: Monthly review; quarterly write-off batch
Volume: ~2,000–3,000 active credit notes at any time (~PHP 15-20M outstanding)
Owner: AR Accountant
Participants: AR Accountant, Finance Manager, Customer Service Manager
Source: workflow W766 — Customer Credit Note Aging Management &amp; Unredeemed Credit Write-Off</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W766_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W766_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W766_Lane2" name="AR Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W766_Lane3" name="Finance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W766_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W766_Start5" name="Monthly credit note aging review cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W766_Task6" name="Monthly credit note aging report generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly credit note aging report generation: System generates aging report: (a) 0-30 days (active), (b) 31-90 days (aging), (c) 91-180 days (stale), (d) 181-365 days (dormant), (e) &gt; 365 days (write-off candidate); categorized by customer type (B2C, trade, corporate), amount band, and store
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W766_Task7" name="Stale credit note customer notification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Stale credit note customer notification: For credit notes in 91-180 day bucket: system generates automated customer notification (SMS, email, app push per W708) reminding customer of outstanding credit with balance and redemption instructions
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): AR Accountant
Duration: Automated + 1 hour review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W766_Task8" name="Dormant credit note escalation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Dormant credit note escalation: For credit notes in 181-365 day bucket: (a) AR Accountant reviews for patterns (same store generating excessive credits, same employee processing); (b) suspicious patterns escalated to LP per W37; (c) customer outreach for high-value dormant credits (&gt; PHP 5,000)
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W766_Task9" name="Quarterly write-off batch preparation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly write-off batch preparation: For credit notes &gt; 365 days: AR Accountant prepares write-off batch with: (a) total amount by customer type, (b) write-off financial impact (revenue reduction per PFRS 15 vs. liability release), (c) BIR compliance considerations (credit notes referenced to VAT-registered invoices require BIR documentation per W540)
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W766_Task10" name="Write-off approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Write-off approval: Finance Manager reviews and approves write-off batch: (a) individual credit notes &gt; PHP 10,000 require CFO approval, (b) aggregate batch per quarter requires Finance Manager approval; system posts write-off: DR Customer Credit Liability / CR Revenue (breakage recognition per FIN-039 PFRS 15)
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO (&gt; PHP 10K)
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W766_Task11" name="Redemption analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Redemption analytics: Monthly: AR Accountant reports: (a) credit note issuance volume by reason, (b) redemption rate by aging bucket, (c) average time to redemption, (d) write-off rate, (e) total credit note liability on balance sheet
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W766_Task12" name="Policy review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Policy review: Annual: Finance Manager reviews credit note policy: (a) expiration period (currently 365 days), (b) minimum redemption threshold (currently PHP 0 — no minimum), (c) proactive notification frequency; recommends adjustments based on analytics
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W766_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W766_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W766_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W766_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-285 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Payment &amp; Reconciliation (PA-15.2).) | - operational: AR Accountant review and approval gate
Owner: AR Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W766_Assoc15" sourceRef="W766_Annotation14" targetRef="W766_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow16" sourceRef="W766_Start5" targetRef="W766_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow17" sourceRef="W766_Task6" targetRef="W766_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow18" sourceRef="W766_Task7" targetRef="W766_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow19" sourceRef="W766_Task8" targetRef="W766_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow20" sourceRef="W766_Task9" targetRef="W766_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow21" sourceRef="W766_Task10" targetRef="W766_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow22" sourceRef="W766_Task11" targetRef="W766_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W766_Flow23" sourceRef="W766_Task12" targetRef="W766_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
